---
import MainLayout from '@layouts/MainLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'May 19, 2026';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Subhan Farrakh"
  description="Privacy policy for subhanfarrakh.com — how your data is collected, used, and protected."
>
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-black text-white py-24 px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">1. Who I Am</h2>
          <p>
            This website is operated by Subhan Farrakh, an independent AI automation engineer and
            freelance developer. If you have any questions about this policy, contact me at{' '}
            <a href="mailto:subhanfarrakh5@gmail.com" class="text-[#1cd8d2] hover:underline">
              subhanfarrakh5@gmail.com
            </a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">2. Information I Collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            I collect only the minimum data necessary to operate this website and respond to inquiries.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Contact form submissions</strong> — name, email address, service
              interest, budget range, and project description. This data is transmitted via EmailJS and
              delivered directly to my inbox. It is not stored on any third-party server beyond what
              EmailJS requires for delivery.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Analytics</strong> — this site uses Vercel Analytics and Vercel
              Speed Insights, which collect anonymised, aggregated performance and visit data. No
              personally identifiable information is tracked. No cookies are set by these services.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">3. How I Use Your Data</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>To respond to project enquiries submitted through the contact form.</li>
            <li>To understand site performance and improve user experience (aggregated analytics only).</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            I do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with any third party for marketing purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">EmailJS</strong> — used to transmit contact form submissions. See
              <a href="https://www.emailjs.com/legal/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#1cd8d2] hover:underline">
                EmailJS Privacy Policy
              </a>.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Vercel Analytics</strong> — privacy-first, cookieless analytics.
              See{' '}
              <a href="https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#1cd8d2] hover:underline">
                Vercel Privacy Policy
              </a>.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Cloudinary</strong> — used to serve images. Images are fetched
              from Cloudinary CDN when you visit pages on this site.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Google Fonts</strong> — font files are loaded from Google's CDN.
              See{' '}
              <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#1cd8d2] hover:underline">
                Google Privacy Policy
              </a>.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">5. Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            This website does not use tracking cookies. Vercel Analytics operates without setting cookies.
            No consent banner is required.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">6. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            Contact form submissions are retained in my email inbox for as long as reasonably necessary
            to handle the enquiry. You may request deletion at any time by emailing me.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">7. Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Depending on your location (e.g., EU/EEA, UK, California), you may have the right to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Access the personal data I hold about you.</li>
            <li>Request correction or deletion of your data.</li>
            <li>Object to or restrict processing of your data.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To exercise any of these rights, email me at{' '}
            <a href="mailto:subhanfarrakh5@gmail.com" class="text-[#1cd8d2] hover:underline">
              subhanfarrakh5@gmail.com
            </a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            I may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page
            reflects when it was last revised.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 flex gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Contact</a>
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">← Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
